		{
			"id": "e4vBdb97vpiJTvp11",
			"description": "Shock Staff",
			"local_notes": "Parry +2 as the Basic Set Quarterstaff.\n\nLore: A two-handed shock weapon issued where reach and crowd control matter more than portability - riot lines, cell-block patrols, and some Ecclesiarchy or penal-world guards; less iconic than the shock maul but built on the same principle.\n\nDesign: A quarterstaff profile (sw+1 cr/thr+1 cr, reach 1,2) carrying the same electro-stun note as the shock maul and electro-flail rather than a new mechanic; the two-handed reach trades the flail's extra damage for the staff's superior defensive profile. Raw damage is left unchanged by the Rescale for the same reason as the rest of the shock-weapon family (it's a mundane, Stun-rule weapon, not one derived from any armour DR anchor). TL/LC match the rest of the shock-weapon family. Handling: parry +2 with no U, the Basic Set Quarterstaff figure (a staff is the one weapon family that parries better than a sword and is not slow to recover). Weight 4 lb (a Basic Set quarterstaff) and min ST 8.",
