		{
			"id": "eaFfu4gGs-496sdxf",
			"description": "Power Stave",
			"local_notes": "This is a mundane-but-powered stave (a two-handed power maul built long, for reach and the Staff skill's defensive bonus), not a psyker's force stave - a force weapon draws on the wielder's own Warp-touched abilities and is covered separately.\n\nLore: Issued to some Inquisitorial acolytes, tech-adepts and Ministorum enforcers who want a power weapon's bite with a quarterstaff's reach and two-handed control rather than a one-handed blade.\n\nDesign: Same power-field rule as Power Maul (+3d, field on vs. off), applied to a two-handed quarterstaff's Basic Set baseline (sw+2 cr/thr+2 cr, reach 1,2) instead of a one-handed mace. Explicitly not the same item as a force stave (a Warp-powered weapon keyed to a psyker's own ability, per framework.md's psychic-power rules) - that variant belongs to the psyker-equipment file, not here. Handling: parry +2 with no U, the Basic Set Quarterstaff figure, as the Shock Staff above. Weight 5 lb and min ST 10.",
