		{
			"id": "e7h4D-DDgXX4POe39",
			"description": "Lightning Claw",
			"local_notes": "Worn as a power-armour or Terminator gauntlet, not swung as a separate object; treat attacks as unarmed strikes enhanced by the claw for skill purposes (Brawling or Karate per framework.md's weapon skill table). See Lightning Claws, Paired below for the two-claw fighting set.\n\nLore: A gauntlet mounting several short power-field blades, worn by specialist Astartes assault troops (Raven Guard and other Chapters with an assault-focused iconography feature prominently); individual claw strikes are lighter than a power sword's but the weapon is built around speed and repeated attacks rather than one heavy blow.\n\nDesign: Applies the power-field rule (+3d, field on vs. off) to a set of short knuckle-blades rather than a full sword: the mundane baseline is a light claw weapon (one step below the plain knife's sw-2 cut on weight and reach grounds, since the blades are short and fixed to a glove rather than a full hilt), giving sw+3d-2(10) cut with the field on. At Astartes ST 30 (sw 5d+2, field-on 8d, average 28) it clears Astartes power armour (DR 100, eff. 10) always and Terminator plate (DR 200, eff. 20) 93.9% of the time, reflecting a fast weapon built around repeated attacks rather than one heavy blow. Handling: an Astartes/Terminator power-armour gauntlet rather than a light hand weapon: the fiction and every model depiction show a bulky, armoured, power-field-generating fist unit integrated into a warplate glove. 12 lb (a bolt-pistol-sized housing plus the field generator and blade assembly) and min ST 13, an Astartes-only figure consistent with the weapon's LC1/Adeptus Astartes-only issue: no human wields one in the fiction. Reach C,1 and parry -1 (Brawling, no axe/mace U convention since it's an unarmed-style weapon). Weight and min ST are lower than the Power Fist's 40 lb/ST 15, reflecting a lighter, faster gauntlet meant to be worn in pairs rather than a single crushing weapon.",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
			"tech_level": "11",
			"legality_class": "1",
			"base_value": "6500",
