		{
			"id": "e39lfsKQJhbTLvMRK",
			"description": "Combat Shield",
			"local_notes": "Riot and line-infantry shield issued to Arbites squads and some Guard formations for close-quarters and crowd-control work; the block bonus above uses the Shield skill as normal.\n\nLore: A round or kite-shaped physical shield seen in Arbites riot-control and some Guard trench-fighting depictions; a mundane defensive tool with no energy field, unlike Astartes storm shields.\n\nDesign: Basic Set Medium Shield stats (DB 2, modelled here as a +2 attribute bonus to Block per data-format.md's supported attribute list) plus the standard shield-bash attack (sw-2 cr); not anchored by framework.md, built from first principles as ordinary Low-Tech gear. Handling: re-derived against Basic Set's actual Medium Shield entry (B287: 15 lb, min ST 9, DB2) - the previous 8 lb/ST 8 figures matched a Small Shield's weight/DB pairing while still claiming DB2, an internal mismatch. Corrected to weight 15, min ST 9, matching a real Medium Shield exactly.",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum",
				"Adeptus Arbites"
			],
			"tech_level": "2",
			"legality_class": "3",
			"base_value": "40",
			"base_weight": "15 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "w4LrH8HrjakdUVvTJ",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "cr",
						"st": "sw",
						"base": "-2"
					},
					"reach": "C,1",
					"parry": "0",
					"strength": "9",
					"usage": "Shield bash",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "dx",
							"modifier": -4
						},
						{
							"type": "skill",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Shield"
							}
						}
